# NF section patterns

## Liquid / schema

- Put instance CSS vars on `#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}` via `{% style %}`.
- Prefer section-local `stylesheet_tag` + deferred script.
- Keep setting **ids** when only changing labels/info/`max`/`min`.
- Range settings: numeric `min` / `max` / `default` only ([docs](https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/architecture/settings/input-settings)).

## CSS

- Prefix all selectors with the section namespace (e.g. `.nf-water-wave`).
- Decorative full-bleed overlays: `pointer-events: none`; keep z-index below header (~50).
- Overlap into neighbors: negative margin on the section class + scoped `overflow: visible` / `z-index` on the Shopify section id — never global `.shopify-section`.

## JS

- Query only this section’s `data-*` roots; do not mutate other sections.
- CSS `-50%` seamless loops require the drawn tile to be **periodic over half the track width**.

## Ship

Content-safe push only the changed section + assets (`--only` + `--nodelete`). Merchants add/configure the section in the Theme Editor.
